        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pick up the pace!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This... nethersea brand. What exactly is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though tiny and varying in form, these fluorescent lifeforms are also an extension of our kin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Torturer Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Prophet once said there's a part of the ocean where these glowing creatures fill the entire sea. They are the Whole, and they shape the cradle of life for our kin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Torturer Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The 'nethersea brand' is just fragments of His will from tens of thousands of nautical miles away, washed in like the tide. Even a tiny amount will inevitably consume the land.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Torturer Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It will turn the land into a new kind of ocean.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Torturer Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Indeed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So Iberia was the first sacrifice for your plans, and Gran Faro is the next.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sacrifice? Surely you're using the wrong word?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Torturer Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Inquisition will take away my town. And this 'beautiful' nethersea brand will do the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Either way it's no longer our home. It'll lose its history, its golden years of explosive growth and vitality.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thiago, surely you don't mean\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Torturer Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jordi has been taken away as well. The ones who escaped have probably all been rounded up by the Penal Battalion by now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're all murderers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_10002",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$Mon3tr_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014 (Screeches excitedly)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mon3tr?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would it show up here?! Impossible! It was just on the west side of town\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Torturer Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You lied to us, Thiago!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Torturer Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you too?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Torturer Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Before becoming an Inquisition spy, I was just the daughter of an ordinary Gran Faro laborer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Townsperson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't underestimate our hatred. All the humiliation we've endured was just to take you all down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Townsperson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Both you lot and the Inquisition are nothing more than enemies trampling over our home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "See for yourself what real destruction looks like. See for yourself what we saw back then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Thiago! Get down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
