    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4042_lumen_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's nothing left to tinker with. Everything else is out of power...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jordi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4042_lumen_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All that remains is to see how long this lighthouse can hold out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jordi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4042_lumen_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(The nethersea brand has already reached this floor?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jordi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4042_lumen_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll have to keep climbing higher.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jordi"
    },
    {
        "text": "High Inquisitor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jordi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "27_g19_lighthouse_front",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "text": "His arms have gone numb."
    },
    {
        "text": "The shape of the reef has already changed dramatically. The High Inquisitor spares no effort when annihilating all enemies in his sight."
    },
    {
        "text": "But his enemies are quite literally endless."
    },
    {
        "text": "His sword is corroded, and he's expended his roll of explosives."
    },
    {
        "text": "Only the flame in his lantern burns even brighter than before."
    },
    {
        "text": "Not once does Dario look behind him, to the lighthouse he has defended from the beginning."
    },
    {
        "text": "He looks beyond the sea's horizon."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Creatures of the sea, Iberia will not be destroyed by you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Humanity will not be destroyed by you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "text": "He hacks up the blood stuck in his throat. A metallic scent fills his nostrils."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_457_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_fish_howl"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Slow slithering sounds)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sea Terror"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I, too, will not be destroyed by you. That would take more than death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
