    },
    {
        "text": "Be patient and wait here, Garcia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Squats beside the captain obediently)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chief Mate"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's always boring, waiting for our quarry to take the bait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still remember the second time we went to hunt these monsters? We still had over a hundred survivors back then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When we first set sail, the air was filled with cheering and salutes from the cannons. Those sounds still echo in our ears to this day. We bid farewell to the grand shore, carrying the legends of \u00c6gir as we sprinted towards the depths.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "After a few days at sea\u2014yes, only a few days\u2014calamity struck.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Graaah... Why did these stupid goddamn cells rob you of your language?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How I wish to chat with you again, rather than those stupid, rancid idiots who took over sixty years to get here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Rubs Alfonso's hand in sorrow)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chief Mate"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Good day, Mister Captain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, we just happened to be short some bait. Fancy a dip? Considering you're an \u00c6gir, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? Already forgotten what I said?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Either you leave, or I toss you overboard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a miracle you survived. I never thought any Iberians would've made it after all this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's got nothing to do with you, or with Iberia. After sixty years, the only thing I belong to is this ship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, we\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me give it a try, Skadi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How goes the hunt?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe my extremely cordial attitude has stoked a number of misunderstandings. But I can tell that the blood of monsters flows in your veins, just like me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're... the same?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You, us, and your chief mate too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Who gave you permission to talk about Garcia? Who gave you permission to LOOK at my Garcia, you filthy \u00c6gir mongrels?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chief Mate"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never told you what Garcia used to be. You don't know if they were a man or a woman, tall or short, fat or skinny, Perro or devil.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But know that Garcia is my chief mate and my lover, and I will never reveal their former self to outsiders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't need your pity, or a comparison to whatever image of us you might have from the past. Neither of us need any of that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a joke. Hunters whose blood is mixed with that of their prey. Not even the ocean's waves can wash away your filth, yet you dare bare your fangs in front of us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Skadi's brows furrow into a frown. She rarely cares about what others have to say, especially land-dwellers. But the words coming from the exception in front of her make her feel uncomfortable."
    },
    {
        "text": "The chief mate shoots a sharp glance at Skadi. It is a warning."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, we need your help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What do you call these monsters again? Sea-something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, 'Seaborn.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, so why should we help you Seaborn? Do you know how many good lads lost their lives to the sea after the calamity?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You float around on these waters and refuse to return to port, yet still insist that you're an enemy of the sea?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yup. That's my life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We are... Abyssal Hunters. We come from \u00c6gir, and while we can only guess how exactly you survived, we have nothing but respect for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We also hope you'll understand that everything we do is to fight against those enemies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I should care about what \u00c6gir does, why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, no, you misunderstand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Skadi shoots a glance at Specter beside her. When she'd said 'let me give it a try,' Skadi thought she meant that she'd be better at negotiating."
    },
    {
        "text": "But drawing her weapon should absolutely not be a part of 'negotiations.'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me rephrase that. It's our job to slaughter them. And I happen to find that process rather enjoyable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since you're only hunting for food, I can leave you some of the meat when I'm done. After all, I've never liked dealing with that nauseating stuff.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... think pretty highly of yourselves, eh? Compared to the Victorians, or Leithanians? I've seen the way you kill Seaborn. You aren't worth a damn thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, don't get us wrong, dealing with these low-level creatures we call Sea Terrors doesn't even count as combat for the 2nd Company. Gladiia isn't exactly the stingy type either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm stronger than you. That's just an indisputable fact.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_skulsrsword",
        "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hraagh...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chief Mate"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My, let's not get ahead of ourselves, Mister Chief Mate. Or, Miss? Anyway, it's not your turn yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Lay a finger on Garcia, and you're dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since our captain's mission is to retrieve this ship and return to \u00c6gir, we don't have the luxury of sitting around trying to convince you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This way's always been the more straightforward means of communication\u2014the Hunters' way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, you've got a death wish!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
