    },
    {
        "text": "Kin, I've come for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "To hunt and consume, is an important matter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You, are not all kin. But I know, you can still return to our kind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I ask, what will you do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name2": "avg_npc_446_1#3$1",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Piss off!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso & Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1"
