        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, now there's an easy way to prove that you're not a Seaborn. Kill it. Unless you're unwilling to attack your 'kin.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I sincerely hope that you won't drag me down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm more worried about you showing mercy to your twisted 'kin,' \u00c6gir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you worry over nothing. After all, if I really was on their side, you'd be dead already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, once I prove I'm not one of them, are you willing to lend us your ship?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not a chance in hell. The ship belongs to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's too bad. Maybe if I help you lose that arm of yours during this battle, that'll wake up a part of your humanity?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chief Mate! Stay back, don't do anything. Let's see how much of a difference there is between us and these monsters claiming to be human.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "text": "You too Skadi, don't snatch my mark. This hunt is mine. And I need to... let off a little bit of steam.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
